{"n":81,"name":"At-Takwir","nameAr":"التكوير","meaning":"The Overthrowing","ayahs":29,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"إِذَا ٱلشَّمْسُ كُوِّرَتْ","en":"When the sun is wrapped up [in darkness]","w":[{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"When"},{"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسُ","tr":"l-shamsu","en":"the sun","root":"شمس","lem":"شَمْس"},{"ar":"كُوِّرَتْ","tr":"kuwwirat","en":"is wrapped up","root":"كور","lem":"كُوِّرَتْ"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ ٱنكَدَرَتْ","en":"And when the stars fall, dispersing,","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلنُّجُومُ","tr":"l-nujūmu","en":"the stars","root":"نجم","lem":"نَجْم"},{"ar":"ٱنكَدَرَتْ","tr":"inkadarat","en":"fall, losing their luster","root":"كدر","lem":"انكَدَرَتْ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتْ","en":"And when the mountains are removed","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْجِبَالُ","tr":"l-jibālu","en":"the mountains","root":"جبل","lem":"جَبَل"},{"ar":"سُيِّرَتْ","tr":"suyyirat","en":"are moved away","root":"سير","lem":"سُيِّرَتْ"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتْ","en":"And when full-term she-camels are neglected","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْعِشَارُ","tr":"l-ʿishāru","en":"the full-term she-camels","root":"عشر","lem":"عِشار"},{"ar":"عُطِّلَتْ","tr":"ʿuṭṭilat","en":"(are) left untended","root":"عطل","lem":"عُطِّلَتْ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتْ","en":"And when the wild beasts are gathered","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْوُحُوشُ","tr":"l-wuḥūshu","en":"the wild beasts","root":"وحش","lem":"وُحُوش"},{"ar":"حُشِرَتْ","tr":"ḥushirat","en":"are gathered","root":"حشر","lem":"حَشَرَ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتْ","en":"And when the seas are filled with flame","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْبِحَارُ","tr":"l-biḥāru","en":"the seas","root":"بحر","lem":"بَحْر"},{"ar":"سُجِّرَتْ","tr":"sujjirat","en":"are made to overflow","root":"سجر","lem":"سُجِّرَتْ"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلنُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتْ","en":"And when the souls are paired","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلنُّفُوسُ","tr":"l-nufūsu","en":"the souls","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"زُوِّجَتْ","tr":"zuwwijat","en":"are paired","root":"زوج","lem":"زُوِّجَتْ"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْمَوْءُۥدَةُ سُئِلَتْ","en":"And when the girl [who was] buried alive is asked","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَوْءُۥدَةُ","tr":"l-mawūdatu","en":"the female infant buried alive","root":"وأد","lem":"مَوْءُدَة"},{"ar":"سُئِلَتْ","tr":"su-ilat","en":"is asked","root":"سأل","lem":"سَأَلَ"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"بِأَىِّ ذَنۢبٍ قُتِلَتْ","en":"For what sin she was killed","w":[{"ar":"بِأَىِّ","tr":"bi-ayyi","en":"For what","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ذَنۢبٍۢ","tr":"dhanbin","en":"sin","root":"ذنب","lem":"ذَنب"},{"ar":"قُتِلَتْ","tr":"qutilat","en":"she was killed","root":"قتل","lem":"قَتَلَ"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتْ","en":"And when the pages are spread [i.e., made public]","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلصُّحُفُ","tr":"l-ṣuḥufu","en":"the pages","root":"صحف","lem":"صُحُف"},{"ar":"نُشِرَتْ","tr":"nushirat","en":"are laid open","root":"نشر","lem":"نُشِرَتْ"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتْ","en":"And when the sky is stripped away","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","tr":"l-samāu","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"كُشِطَتْ","tr":"kushiṭat","en":"is stripped away","root":"كشط","lem":"كُشِطَتْ"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتْ","en":"And when Hellfire is set ablaze","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْجَحِيمُ","tr":"l-jaḥīmu","en":"the Hellfire","root":"جحم","lem":"جَحِيم"},{"ar":"سُعِّرَتْ","tr":"suʿʿirat","en":"is set ablaze","root":"سعر","lem":"سُعِّرَتْ"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْجَنَّةُ أُزْلِفَتْ","en":"And when Paradise is brought near,","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةُ","tr":"l-janatu","en":"Paradise","root":"جنن","lem":"جَنَّة"},{"ar":"أُزْلِفَتْ","tr":"uz'lifat","en":"is brought near","root":"زلف","lem":"أُزْلِفَتْ"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّآ أَحْضَرَتْ","en":"A soul will [then] know what it has brought [with it].","w":[{"ar":"عَلِمَتْ","tr":"ʿalimat","en":"Will know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"نَفْسٌۭ","tr":"nafsun","en":"a soul","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"مَّآ","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"أَحْضَرَتْ","tr":"aḥḍarat","en":"it has brought","root":"حضر","lem":"أَحْضَرَتْ"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلْخُنَّسِ","en":"So I swear by the retreating stars -","w":[{"ar":"فَلَآ","tr":"falā","en":"But nay"},{"ar":"أُقْسِمُ","tr":"uq'simu","en":"I swear","root":"قسم","lem":"أَقْسَمُ"},{"ar":"بِٱلْخُنَّسِ","tr":"bil-khunasi","en":"by the retreating planets","root":"خنس","lem":"خُنَّس"}]},{"n":16,"juz":30,"ar":"ٱلْجَوَارِ ٱلْكُنَّسِ","en":"Those that run [their courses] and disappear [i.e., set]","w":[{"ar":"ٱلْجَوَارِ","tr":"al-jawāri","en":"Those that run","root":"جري","lem":"جَوار"},{"ar":"ٱلْكُنَّسِ","tr":"l-kunasi","en":"(and) disappear","root":"كنس","lem":"كُنَّس"}]},{"n":17,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا عَسْعَسَ","en":"And by the night as it closes in","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"wa-al-layli","en":"And the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"عَسْعَسَ","tr":"ʿasʿasa","en":"it departs","root":"عسعس","lem":"عَسْعَسَ"}]},{"n":18,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلصُّبْحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ","en":"And by the dawn when it breathes [i.e., stirs]","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلصُّبْحِ","tr":"wal-ṣub'ḥi","en":"And the dawn","root":"صبح","lem":"صُبْح"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"تَنَفَّسَ","tr":"tanaffasa","en":"it breathes","root":"نفس","lem":"تَنَفَّسَ"}]},{"n":19,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولٍ كَرِيمٍ","en":"[That] indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger [i.e., Gabriel]","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, it"},{"ar":"لَقَوْلُ","tr":"laqawlu","en":"(is) surely a word","root":"قول","lem":"قَوْل"},{"ar":"رَسُولٍۢ","tr":"rasūlin","en":"(of) a Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"كَرِيمٍۢ","tr":"karīmin","en":"noble","root":"كرم","lem":"كَرِيم"}]},{"n":20,"juz":30,"ar":"ذِى قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِى ٱلْعَرْشِ مَكِينٍ","en":"[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position],","w":[{"ar":"ذِى","tr":"dhī","en":"Possessor of"},{"ar":"قُوَّةٍ","tr":"quwwatin","en":"power","root":"قوي","lem":"قُوَّة"},{"ar":"عِندَ","tr":"ʿinda","en":"with","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"ذِى","tr":"dhī","en":"(the) Owner of"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ","tr":"l-ʿarshi","en":"the Throne","root":"عرش","lem":"عَرْش"},{"ar":"مَكِينٍۢ","tr":"makīnin","en":"secure","root":"مكن","lem":"مَكِين"}]},{"n":21,"juz":30,"ar":"مُّطَاعٍ ثَمَّ أَمِينٍ","en":"Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy.","w":[{"ar":"مُّطَاعٍۢ","tr":"muṭāʿin","en":"One to be obeyed","root":"طوع","lem":"مُطاع"},{"ar":"ثَمَّ","tr":"thamma","en":"and"},{"ar":"أَمِينٍۢ","tr":"amīnin","en":"trustworthy","root":"أمن","lem":"أَمِين"}]},{"n":22,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا صَاحِبُكُم بِمَجْنُونٍ","en":"And your companion [i.e., Prophet Muḥammad (ﷺ) ] is not [at all] mad.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"صَاحِبُكُم","tr":"ṣāḥibukum","en":"(is) your companion","root":"صحب","lem":"صاحِب"},{"ar":"بِمَجْنُونٍۢ","tr":"bimajnūnin","en":"mad","root":"جنن","lem":"مَجْنُون"}]},{"n":23,"juz":30,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ رَءَاهُ بِٱلْأُفُقِ ٱلْمُبِينِ","en":"And he has already seen him [i.e., Gabriel] in the clear horizon.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","tr":"walaqad","en":"And certainly"},{"ar":"رَءَاهُ","tr":"raāhu","en":"he saw him","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"بِٱلْأُفُقِ","tr":"bil-ufuqi","en":"in the horizon","root":"أفق","lem":"أُفُق"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينِ","tr":"l-mubīni","en":"the clear","root":"بين","lem":"مُبِين"}]},{"n":24,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ٱلْغَيْبِ بِضَنِينٍ","en":"And he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"he (is)"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","tr":"l-ghaybi","en":"the unseen","root":"غيب","lem":"غَيْب"},{"ar":"بِضَنِينٍۢ","tr":"biḍanīnin","en":"a withholder","root":"ضنن","lem":"ضَنِين"}]},{"n":25,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَيْطَـٰنٍ رَّجِيمٍ","en":"And it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens].","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"it"},{"ar":"بِقَوْلِ","tr":"biqawli","en":"(is the) word","root":"قول","lem":"قَوْل"},{"ar":"شَيْطَـٰنٍۢ","tr":"shayṭānin","en":"(of) Shaitaan","root":"شطن","lem":"شَيْطان"},{"ar":"رَّجِيمٍۢ","tr":"rajīmin","en":"accursed","root":"رجم","lem":"رَجِيم"}]},{"n":26,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَيْنَ تَذْهَبُونَ","en":"So where are you going?","w":[{"ar":"فَأَيْنَ","tr":"fa-ayna","en":"So where"},{"ar":"تَذْهَبُونَ","tr":"tadhhabūna","en":"are you going","root":"ذهب","lem":"ذَهَبَ"}]},{"n":27,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرٌ لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en":"It is not except a reminder to the worlds","w":[{"ar":"إِنْ","tr":"in","en":"Not"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"it"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"(is) except"},{"ar":"ذِكْرٌۭ","tr":"dhik'run","en":"a reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْر"},{"ar":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","tr":"lil'ʿālamīna","en":"to the worlds","root":"علم","lem":"عالَم"}]},{"n":28,"juz":30,"ar":"لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمْ أَن يَسْتَقِيمَ","en":"For whoever wills among you to take a right course.","w":[{"ar":"لِمَن","tr":"liman","en":"For whoever"},{"ar":"شَآءَ","tr":"shāa","en":"wills","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"مِنكُمْ","tr":"minkum","en":"among you"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"to"},{"ar":"يَسْتَقِيمَ","tr":"yastaqīma","en":"take a straight way","root":"قوم","lem":"اسْتَقامُ"}]},{"n":29,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en":"And you do not will except that Allāh wills - Lord of the worlds.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"تَشَآءُونَ","tr":"tashāūna","en":"you will","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"إِلَّآ","tr":"illā","en":"except"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"يَشَآءَ","tr":"yashāa","en":"wills","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"رَبُّ","tr":"rabbu","en":"Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","tr":"l-ʿālamīna","en":"(of) the worlds","root":"علم","lem":"عالَم"}]}]}